.playwright-browsers/
INVESTIGATION*.md
investigation_output/
downloads/

# VCR cassettes - committed after security review
# Cassettes are scrubbed of sensitive data (cookies, tokens, user IDs, emails)
# See tests/vcr_config.py for scrubbing patterns

# Local working notes (process scratch — not shipped)
docs/scratch/

# Baked into the wheel by hatch_build.py; never committed.
src/notebooklm/_commit.py

# Mobile reverse-engineering working files (local only)
# The APK is ~39MB of Google's proprietary binaries — never commit it.
notebooklm.apk/
frida-scripts/
error.log

# NCERT → NotebookLM pipeline: generated outputs and local run state
# (keep run.py / README.md / COMMANDS.md tracked; ignore everything generated)
pipeline/output/
pipeline/progress.csv
pipeline/pipeline.log
pipeline/.pipeline.lock
# Google Drive credentials for the pipeline — secrets, never commit
pipeline/client_secret.json
pipeline/.drive_token.json
